{"seq":2,"slug":"merchant-billing","title":"商家账单、对账与发票","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-seller-platform/settlement-billing/merchant-billing","wordCount":3014,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"商家账单-对账与发票\">商家账单、对账与发票</h1><p>每月 1 号的凌晨，卖家打开 Seller Center 的「账单」页，看到一张金额为 12,480.32 欧元的账单。他会做三件事：看总额对不对、点开某一行看它是怎么来的、然后跟自己的 ERP 或记账核对。这三件事分别对应账单系统的三个能力——<strong>聚合正确</strong>、<strong>可下钻</strong>、<strong>可对账</strong>。任何一项缺失，卖家就会打客服电话，而客服无法回答，因为答案散在五个系统里。本文要把费用流水聚合成一张能被解释、能被核对、能被审计的凭证，并说清跨境场景下发票与税的两向要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-账单是快照-不是视图\">核心概念：账单是快照，不是视图</h2><p>第一个判断是账单的形态。有两种候选：<strong>账单是实时视图</strong>（页面每次打开都从流水聚合）与<strong>账单是定期快照</strong>（按结算周期固化一张账单及其明细）。必须选后者，理由有三。</p>\n<p><strong>理由一：账单一旦发给卖家就不应该变。</strong> 若账单是实时视图，那么卖家在 3 号看到 12,480.32，在 5 号因为一笔迟到的退款回填看到 12,410.32——他会立刻怀疑平台的计费可靠性。快照让「3 号发出的账单」永久有效，后续变化以<strong>下一期的调整行</strong>出现。这与财务上「不修改已开出的凭证，用调整凭证更正」是同一个原则。</p>\n<p><strong>理由二：对账需要一个静止的比对对象。</strong> 卖家拿自己的账去核对时，双方必须在比同一个不变的数；实时视图会让比对变成追逐移动目标。</p>\n<p><strong>理由三：账单是法律与税务意义上的凭证。</strong> 在多数市场，平台向卖家开具的结算单或发票需要是确定的内容，且要能被追溯与留存。</p>\n<p>由此推出账单的状态机：<code>draft</code>（周期内聚合，未定稿）→ <code>closed</code>（周期结束、定稿）→ <code>issued</code>（已发给卖家）→ <code>paid</code>（已打款）→ 后续通过 <code>adjustment</code> 行关联到下一期。允许的修正只发生在 <code>draft</code> 阶段；<code>closed</code> 之后一律走下期调整。这与 <a href=\"../onboarding-kyc/merchant-onboarding-flow\">入驻流程、状态与审核工单</a> 中「结论一旦给出即锚定」是同一类纪律：<strong>已输出的凭证不改</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[费用流水 fee_ledger] --&gt; B[按结算周期聚合&lt;br/&gt;draft]&#10;    C[扣款与冻结调整] --&gt; B&#10;    D[退款与冲销] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E{周期结束}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[closed 定稿&lt;br/&gt;冻结明细快照]&#10;    F --&gt; G[issued 发给卖家]&#10;    G --&gt; H[打款支付]&#10;    H --&gt; I[paid]&#10;    G --&gt; J[卖家提出异议]&#10;    J --&gt; K[差异分类与修复]&#10;    K --&gt;|需修正| L[下期 adjustment 行]&#10;    K --&gt;|已正确| M[回复说明并关闭]\">graph TD\n    A[费用流水 fee_ledger] --&gt; B[按结算周期聚合&lt;br/&gt;draft]\n    C[扣款与冻结调整] --&gt; B\n    D[退款与冲销] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E{周期结束}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[closed 定稿&lt;br/&gt;冻结明细快照]\n    F --&gt; G[issued 发给卖家]\n    G --&gt; H[打款支付]\n    H --&gt; I[paid]\n    G --&gt; J[卖家提出异议]\n    J --&gt; K[差异分类与修复]\n    K --&gt;|需修正| L[下期 adjustment 行]\n    K --&gt;|已正确| M[回复说明并关闭]</pre><h2 id=\"结算周期的界定与跨时区切分\">结算周期的界定与跨时区切分</h2><p>「这个月的账单」必须有一个精确的边界定义，而跨境场景下这个定义会变得不平凡。</p>\n<p><strong>周期的界定基准有三种候选</strong>：按订单创建时间、按订单完成时间（买家收货/确认）、按资金到账时间。选哪个取决于业务对「什么时候算赚到」的定义。对卖家最公平且最常用的是<strong>按订单完成时间</strong>，因为未完成的订单还可能被取消或退款，把它们算进本月会让账单反复调整。但要注意：如果订单在 3 月 28 日完成、买家在 4 月 10 日退款，则 3 月账单是含它的完整收入，4 月账单要有一笔退款调整——这是正常的，也是「调整行必须存在」的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>跨时区切分</strong>是跨境特有的坑。周期边界通常是平台设定的一个时区下的时刻（例如 UTC 00:00 或卖家属地时区）。若各系统的时间口径不一致——订单库记 UTC、结算任务按服务器本地时间、卖家面板按演示时区——则同一订单会在两个周期里出现或都不出现。处理方式是：<strong>周期边界以 UTC 表达并落在配置里，所有时间戳存 UTC，展示层按请求时区渲染</strong>。切分逻辑必须有一个单一实现（一个函数），任何第二处实现都会漂移。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>order.completed_at</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>计入本周期</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0, t_1) \\cap \\{ \\text{order.completed\\_at} \\} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\text{计入本周期}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order.completed_at</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计入本周期</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用半开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0, t_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是闭区间是必要的：闭区间会让边界时刻的订单在两个相邻周期里各出现一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账单的聚合与下钻\">账单的聚合与下钻</h2><p>账单的结构有三层：账单头（期间、主体、站点、币种、总额）、账单分组（按期或按费用类型）、账单行（每一行指向一组费用流水）。下钻能力的关键是<strong>每个聚合层级都能回答「你这行数从哪些流水来」</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE settlement_statement (&#10;  statement_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entity_id    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  shop_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  site_market  CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency     CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  period_start DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  period_end   DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  gross_amount DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  fee_total    DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  adjustment_total DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  net_amount   DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  status       VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  closed_at    DATETIME(3),&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_period (shop_id, site_market, currency, period_start)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE statement_line (&#10;  line_id      BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  statement_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  line_type    VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- commission | fulfillment | refund | reserve | payout&#10;  count_items  INT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount       DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency     CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  KEY idx_statement (statement_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> settlement_statement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  statement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shop_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  site_market  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_end   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fee_total    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  adjustment_total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_period (shop_id, site_market, currency, period_start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> statement_line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  statement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- commission | fulfillment | refund | reserve | payout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  count_items  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_statement (statement_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>statement_line</code> 不存明细而存<strong>聚合 + 计数</strong>，明细由 <code>fee_ledger</code> 通过 <code>(statement_id, line_type)</code> 关联查询得到。这样做的好处是账单表本身轻量（几万卖家 × 几个线 × 每月 = 可控行数），而明细留在流水表里按需查。代价是下钻查询要能在流水表上按 <code>statement_id</code> 高效检索，因此 <code>fee_ledger</code> 需要一个 <code>statement_id</code> 列（计费后可空，聚合时回填）与索引。这个设计是「聚合表 + 明细表分离」的标准做法，与本 hub 其他「快照 + 流水」结构一致。</p>\n<p>账单行的<strong>计数（<code>count_items</code>）是必要的</strong>，且它不只是展示用。卖家第一眼核对的往往不是金额而是条数（「我这月成交 320 单，账单上佣金行说 331 单」），条数不符是最快定位差异的入口。因此计数必须与金额来自同一次聚合，不能分别计算。</p>\n<p>币种的处理需要明确：<strong>一个账单只有一个币种</strong>。若卖家在德国站收欧元、在印尼站收印尼盾，则这是<strong>两张账单</strong>（不同站点、不同币种），它们在卖家面板上可以被汇总展示，但凭证是分开的。把多币种塞进一张账单会让「净额」失去意义，除非引入一个换算后的展示币种——那是展示层的计算，不应写进凭证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异分类与修复\">差异分类与修复</h2><p>对账差异是不可避免的，重要的是<strong>分类</strong>。可操作的分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>修复方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时区切分</td>\n<td>周期边界口径不一致</td>\n<td>同一订单在两期或零期出现</td>\n<td>统一 UTC 边界 + 单一切分函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迟到事件</td>\n<td>退款/扣款事件晚到</td>\n<td>本期少一笔、下期多一笔</td>\n<td>下期调整行（不改历史）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复计费</td>\n<td>消息重复投递</td>\n<td>同一订单两条佣金</td>\n<td>幂等键唯一索引拦截 + 冲正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率差异</td>\n<td>费用与退款汇率不同</td>\n<td>净额与直觉不符</td>\n<td>记录费率快照并在账单标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代收税混淆</td>\n<td>过手资金与收入混记</td>\n<td>收入虚增</td>\n<td>税单独立成行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家侧错误</td>\n<td>卖家自己漏记</td>\n<td>单向差异</td>\n<td>提供订单级明细供其核对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>修复的<strong>唯一正确方式是追加调整</strong>，永远不是修改历史账单行或删除流水。这与只追加账本的原则完全一致：更正一笔错误用红冲（追加一条方向相反的条目），而原条目永久保留——本文不重复其推导。调整行需要<strong>指向被调整的原行</strong>（<code>adjust_ref</code>）与原因码，这样「下期这笔 -42.10 是什么」有答案。</p>\n<p>对账还要能<strong>自动</strong>发现差异，否则只能等卖家投诉。可自动化的检查包括：流水与账单聚合之和是否相等（内部自洽）、流水总额与支付服务商的清算报告是否相等（外部对账）、卖家余额与流水累计是否相等（余额自洽）。这三层收敛顺序是「内部自洽 → 余额自洽 → 外部对账」，先从内层查起，因为内层失败会让外层检查失去意义。外部对账的原始数据来自资金通道的结算文件，需按清算批次逐笔勾对，未匹配项进入人工队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发票-两向开具与税务要求\">发票：两向开具与税务要求</h2><p>跨境结算里「发票」一词指两个不同方向的东西，混为一谈会导致合规问题。</p>\n<p><strong>方向一：平台向卖家开票。</strong> 内容是平台收取的佣金与服务费。在多数市场这是平台作为服务提供方开给卖家的税务发票，需要包含平台与卖家的税务标识、税率、税额、发票号与开票日期，且要符合当地的格式与留存要求（欧盟多数国家要求发票含特定字段，并对发票编号有连续性要求）。这张票的金额与账单上的平台收入部分对应，<strong>不含过手资金</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>方向二：卖家向买家开票。</strong> 内容是他销售的商品。若平台被认定为视同供应商（marketplace facilitator），则开票义务在平台而非卖家；否则卖家需要自行开具。系统要能按站点的 <code>tax_mode</code> 决定由谁开票、用什么格式。</p>\n<p>工程上的要点有三。<strong>发票号必须由系统唯一分配且可验证</strong>（连续或按规则的序列，不能重复、不能跳号，因为监管会检查）。<strong>发票内容必须来自不可变快照</strong>（开票时的账单内容），因为发票一旦开出就不能改，只能开红字发票冲销。<strong>发票要能被批量生成与下载</strong>，因为卖家（尤其是有会计的卖家）需要 PDF 归档。</p>\n<p>还有一条容易被忽略：<strong>发票的语言与币种</strong>要与目标市场的税务要求匹配。德国要求德语发票（或至少关键字段德语）、意大利有电子发票（SdI）的平台接入要求——意大利自 2019-01-01 起对企业的电子发票义务已生效（来源：Electronic invoicing, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electronic_invoicing）、部分市场要求发票以当地货币或可换算的货币开具。这些差异必须表达为**站点级的开票策略**而不是代码分支，与\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electronic_invoicing）、部分市场要求发票以当地货币或可换算的货币开具。这些差异必须表达为**站点级的开票策略**而不是代码分支，与</a> <a href=\"../onboarding-kyc/kyc-qualification\">商家 KYC/资质与分市场合规</a> 的市场门禁是同一套「差异即数据」的思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提现-账单到资金\">提现：账单到资金</h2><p>账单定稿之后是提现。提现需要与账单解耦，因为<strong>可提现余额不等于本期账单净额</strong>——它还要扣除：预留金（见 <a href=\"merchant-dispute\">扣款/冻结/纠纷处理</a>）、尚未解除的冻结、以及可能的最低余额要求。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>net_amount</mtext><mtext>已定稿账单</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>reserve_held</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>frozen</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>min_balance</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{withdrawable} = \\sum \\text{net\\_amount}_{\\text{已定稿账单}} - \\text{reserve\\_held} - \\text{frozen} - \\text{min\\_balance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1186em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已定稿账单</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3597em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve_held</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frozen</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min_balance</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>提现的状态机需要显式（申请 → 审核/风控 → 划付 → 到账或失败），且<strong>提现申请必须幂等</strong>（重复点击不能扣两次）。到账失败的处置是回到余额而不是丢失，并记录失败原因（收款账户信息错误是常见原因，而它把本文与 <a href=\"../permissions-subaccount/subaccount-audit\">子账号操作审计与风控</a> 的银行账户修改冷却期串了起来——改了账户立刻提现正是攻击者的典型路径，因此提现应校验账户的冷却期状态）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>账单系统的验收标准是：卖家点开任意一行，能在三次点击内看到支撑它的原始事实。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>账单是<strong>定期快照</strong>不是实时视图；<code>closed</code> 之后只通过<strong>下期调整行</strong>修正，绝不改历史。</li>\n<li>周期边界用 <strong>UTC 表达 + 半开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0,t_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> + 单一实现</strong>；完成时点是推荐的计入基准。</li>\n<li>账单三层（头/分组/行），行内存<strong>聚合与计数</strong>，明细由流水按 <code>statement_id</code> 下钻；<strong>一个凭证一个币种</strong>。</li>\n<li>差异必须<strong>分类修复</strong>（时区、迟到、重复、汇率、税混淆、卖家侧），修复方式是追加调整并指向 <code>adjust_ref</code>。</li>\n<li>自动对账三层收敛：<strong>内部自洽 → 余额自洽 → 外部清算勾对</strong>。</li>\n<li>发票<strong>双向</strong>：平台向卖家开票只含平台收入（不含过手税）、卖家向买家开票由站点 <code>tax_mode</code> 决定；票号唯一连续、内容取快照、语言币种按市场策略。</li>\n<li>提现与账单解耦：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>net</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>reserve</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>frozen</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = \\sum \\text{net} - \\text{reserve} - \\text{frozen} - \\text{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frozen</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span>，申请幂等，校验账户冷却期。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文聚合 <a href=\"commission-fee-model\">佣金/平台费/分账模型</a> 产出的费用流水；它的异常来源与预留金、扣款、冻结见 <a href=\"merchant-dispute\">扣款/冻结/纠纷处理</a>；主体与站点的归属见 <a href=\"../onboarding-kyc/merchant-account-model\">主体/店铺/站点账户模型</a>；过手税与币种口径归多币种结算域。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商家账单、对账与发票","id":"商家账单-对账与发票"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：账单是快照，不是视图","id":"核心概念-账单是快照-不是视图"},{"level":2,"text":"结算周期的界定与跨时区切分","id":"结算周期的界定与跨时区切分"},{"level":2,"text":"账单的聚合与下钻","id":"账单的聚合与下钻"},{"level":2,"text":"差异分类与修复","id":"差异分类与修复"},{"level":2,"text":"发票：两向开具与税务要求","id":"发票-两向开具与税务要求"},{"level":2,"text":"提现：账单到资金","id":"提现-账单到资金"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"佣金/平台费/分账模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-seller-platform/settlement-billing/commission-fee-model"},"next":{"title":"扣款/冻结/纠纷处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-seller-platform/settlement-billing/merchant-dispute"}}